{"reviewId": "314442061_87HntL1Kj", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "2026年的中国经济并不属于滞涨，也非典型的通缩，而是出于温和再通胀的过渡阶段。\n1、CPI（居民消费）已转正回升，服务、核心消费价格在涨￼￼￼\n2、PPI（工业生产）降幅收窄、环比持续上涨，通缩压力缓解￼￼￼\n3、GDP温和增长\n总结：当前“经济复苏+物价温和回升”的周期阶段，将大宗商品+黄金作为资产配置的一部分，是一个非常顺势而为的策略\n", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "4712-4780", "abstract": "康波从萧条向回升的转换本质上就是从滞胀向通缩的转换，此时经济增速不断下降，商品价格明显回落，通缩成为社会的共识，这个过程也有10年之久。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "314442061_87HntL1Kj", "userVid": 314442061, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773836068, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 314442061, "name": "对方正在输入...", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-97qgtLWUKpTvAhB5VSDIz10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": ""}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 418609871, "name": "周榆悦（📖遥远的救世主", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0015-xwh1M0n00iHO8OiAk~~MSfa/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "周榆悦（📖遥远的救世主", "isV": 1, "vDesc": "逻辑学｜经济学｜历史｜军事｜政治｜哲学", "roleTags": ["优质荐书达人"], "followPromote": "Ta已帮助28038位书友找到心仪书籍", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-5000", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "书海指明灯", "levelIndex": 5000}}], "commentsCount": 3, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "经济复苏阶段，是不适宜配置大宗商品的，大宗商品适合在衰退阶段配置", "reviewId": "314442061_87HntL1Kj", "commentId": "314442061_87HntL1Kj